# 12.10 Notification APIs

Notification endpoints retrieve unread notifications, mark notifications as read, delete obsolete notifications, and synchronize notification preferences.

Notifications originate from numerous application events including incoming messages, group invitations, message reactions, mentions, profile updates, and administrative announcements.

Unread notification counts update continuously through WebSocket synchronization while REST endpoints provide permanent historical retrieval.

Notification preferences allow users to customize alert behavior according to individual requirements.

