The modular architecture supports future expansion through additional API versions without disrupting existing client applications. Potential enhancements include GraphQL support, push notification services, voice and video communication endpoints, AI-assisted message translation, intelligent search capabilities, chatbot integrations, webhook support, and external developer APIs.

Backward compatibility remains an important design objective during future interface evolution.

